smb: client: let send_done handle a completion without IB_SEND_SIGNALED

jira KERNEL-1677
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-5.14.0-687.52.1.el9_8
commit-author Stefan Metzmacher <metze@samba.org>
commit cf74fcdc43b322b6188a0750b5ee79e38be6d078
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-5.14.0-687.52.1.el9_8/cf74fcdc.failed

With smbdirect_send_batch processing we likely have requests without
IB_SEND_SIGNALED, which will be destroyed in the final request
that has IB_SEND_SIGNALED set.

If the connection is broken all requests are signaled
even without explicit IB_SEND_SIGNALED.

